## matplotlib settings for what the agent runs (the launcher points MATPLOTLIBRC
## here when the account has no matplotlibrc of its own).
##
## Agg: figures are saved to files, which view-outputs shows the model, and a
## stray plt.show() returns instead of opening a window - on macOS the default
## GUI backend can hang a command until it is closed. A Jupyter kernel is not
## affected: ipykernel sets MPLBACKEND to its inline backend when it is unset,
## and MPLBACKEND outranks this file, so notebooks keep their inline figures.
backend: Agg
